{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \b \fs36 Settle Time Explanation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The summary boxes above the plots work as follows:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Distance:} The total commanded distance for the plotted relative move.\line {\b Total Move Time:} The total time from the start of the move to when the controller indicates the move is completed based on the Motion Complete Mode settings (see the {\i \u8220"Set Motion Complete Mode\u8221"} box).\line {\b Trajectory Time:} The total time from the start of the move until the commanded trajectory is completed.\line {\b Settle Time:} The time from when the Trajectory is completed to when the controller indicates the move is completed based on the Motion Complete Mode settings (see the {\i \u8220"Set Motion Complete Mode\u8221"} box).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\pict\pngblip\picw517\pich407\picwgoal7836\pichgoal6169\bin }\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 If {\i \u8220"Position for Motion Complete\u8221"} is set to {\b Commanded}, the controller indicates the move is completed when the commanded trajectory is completed (trajectory generator registers for velocity and acceleration are set to 0).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 If {\i \u8220"Position for Motion Complete\u8221"} is set to {\b Actual} AND {\i \u8220"Settle Time\u8221"} is set to {\b 0}, the controller will indicate the move is complete when the absolute value of the Position Error is less than the {\i \u8220"Settle Window\u8221"} value.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 If {\i \u8220"Position for Motion Complete\u8221"} is set to {\b Actual} AND {\i \u8220"Settle Time\u8221"} is {\b > 0}, the controller will indicate the move is complete when the trajectory is completed AND the absolute value of the Position Error is less than the {\i \u8220"Settle Window\u8221"} value FOR the amount of time indicated by the {\i \u8220"Settle Time\u8221"} value.\par}
